<title>ITALY: ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S DOWNHILL TRAINING TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S DOWNHILL TRAINING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>CORTINA D'AMPEZZO, Italy 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times in</p>
<p>two training runs on Thursday for Friday's women's World Cup</p>
